  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Rinse the freekeh. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over a medium-high heat. Add the freekeh and toast until fragrant, 2 minutes. Add the water (for the freekeh) and the crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2 people / 2 cubes for 4 people). Bring to the boil then reduce to medium\u0002high heat and cook until tender, 30-35 minutes.\n• Drain well and return to the saucepan.\n• TIP: The freekeh is ready when it has softened but still retains some bite.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-5c7f0236.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the freekeh is cooking, cut the cauliflower into small florets. Cut the beetroot (unpeeled) into 1cm chunks. Cut the red onion into 2cm wedges.\n• TIP: Cut the veggies to size so they cook in time.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-b117de1f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the cauliflower, beetroot and onion on an oven tray lined with baking paper. Add the Souk Market spice blend, a drizzle of oil from the marinated goat cheese tub and a generous pinch of salt and pepper. Toss to combine, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-142c52dc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a medium frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the flaked almonds and toast, tossing, until golden, 2-3 minutes. In a large bowl, combine oil from the marinated goat cheese tub (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) with the vinegar and honey. Season with salt and pepper and mix well to combine, set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-2967e629.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the rocket & spinach mix, slightly cooled roast veggies and freekeh to the dressing and toss well to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-7313f144.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the spiced cauliflower salad between plates.\n• Tear the goat cheese into small chunks and scatter over the salad. Sprinkle with the toasted almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6020bc4742ad5f1b2f0fb0cd/step-35799ac4.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
